# Doom legend. Freedoom, the cells the palette chooser publishes.
# Written 2026-11-11. Source wad: #.NNEST_ASSETS/doom/freedoom1.wad
# The chooser lists sprites/doom/flats and sprites/doom/sprites. Each cell is NNN/sprite.csv plus name.txt.
# publish_doom stops at the first missing number, and MAX_TILES caps the list. These are the first 64 flats and the first 64 sprites in that slice, not the whole wad.
# The 64 sprites are all BOSS* frames. Later wad sprites are not in the chooser.
